{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14221170","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14221170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422116001:":{"text":"저건... 아이샤?!","source_cn":"那是……艾莎？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BBDC150C4A8087D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422116002:":{"text":"비키십시오, 로르디! 이미 죄악화가...!","source_cn":"让开！洛尔迪！她已经孽化了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD684F8A4A8A09E30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1422116003:":{"text":"아이샤를 해치지 마!","source_cn":"我不允许任何人再伤害她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x236ED17800A850DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422117001:1":{"text":"나도 알아. 전부 돌이킬 수 없어. 나도 아마 곧...","source_cn":"其实我知道，一切都已经无济于事了，我也马上就要……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EC212159D1C97ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422117002:1":{"text":"그러니까, 우리를 해방시켜 줘.","source_cn":"请你们帮我和她解脱吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68EA082A62560F8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422117003:1":{"text":"나도 의식이 흐릿해지고 있어. 이제 기억나는 건...","source_cn":"我的意识已经开始模糊不清了，我现在只能记得……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF871FC47D768476A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422117004:0":{"text":"아이샤와 나눴던 대화 뿐이야...","source_cn":"只能记得那时艾莎对我说过的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC0BAE7B35932292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422117005:1":{"text":"로르디, 좋아! 네 연인이 될게!","source_cn":"洛尔迪，我答应你，我愿意成为你的爱人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A201C17C184C41B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422117006:0":{"text":"아이샤...! 정말? 우리 사이를 가로막는 걸, 신경쓰지 않는 거야?!","source_cn":"艾莎……！你真的愿意？！你不介意那些阻挡着我们的东西了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC07CDFB1C3E5ACF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422117007:1":{"text":"...신경쓰여. 하지만 서로에게 솔직해야 하잖아!","source_cn":"……介意，但是我知道，我们都要诚实地面对自己！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D6FBB4BD3D7B746","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422117008:1":{"text":"이 반지에 맹세하자. 절대로 잊지 않고, 절대로 외면하지 않고, 절대로 배신하지 않기로...","source_cn":"以戒指为证，我们永不遗忘，永不逃避，永不背叛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01C2B519B80872B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422117009:0":{"text":"절대로 잊지 않고, 절대로 외면하지 않고, 절대로 배신하지 않기...","source_cn":"永不遗忘，永不逃避，永不背叛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48D8F348973EE672","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422117010:1":{"text":"제발, 내가 아직 이 말을 기억하고 있을 때 우리를 고통에서 해방시켜줘!","source_cn":"求你们了，趁我还能记得这些，结束我和她的痛苦吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE58FB9D3539EAECC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422117011:1":{"text":"처음으로 돌아갈 수 있다면, 차라리 만나지 않았으면 좋았을 거야. 내가 아이샤를 불행하게 만들었어...","source_cn":"如果能重来，我希望我们从未相遇，这样我就不会给她带来那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AB92DBEABF43415","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:22:1422116001:":{"text":"저건... 아이샤?!","source_cn":"那是……艾莎？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BBDC150C4A8087D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:22:1422116002:":{"text":"비키십시오, 로르디! 이미 죄악화가...!","source_cn":"让开！洛尔迪！她已经孽化了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD684F8A4A8A